<title>MEXICO: U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Aug 28.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean sales to Mexico - update to Aug 28.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Soybean Association updated Wednesday, via its local office, U.S. exports of soybeans to Mexico.</p>
<p>Volumes are in tonnes, accumulated week-on-week for the marketing year Sept 1 - Aug 31.</p>
<p>    Week Ending    Accum Total    Week Ending    Accum Total</p>
<p>    13/07/95	  1,526,000	16/07/96	   N/A</p>
<p>    20/07/95	  1,577,000	24/07/96	 2,368,000</p>
<p>    03/08/95	  1,645,000	31/07/96	 2,402,000</p>
<p>    24/08/95	  1,772,000	21/08/96	 2,573,000</p>
<p>    31/08/95	  1,845,000	28/07/96	 2,619,000</p>
<p>--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
